/steam/apps/1397300/extras/be79ca1ab9293d25267a3a62ca043f15.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Discover a variety of random events and quests !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/164000c5a257cfa39dd5247d53874395.webp?t=1713864504\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/66ed15220574e427443a7692f155f567.poster.avif?t=1713864504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/66ed15220574e427443a7692f155f567.webm?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/66ed15220574e427443a7692f155f567.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Build a variety of objects and constructions, go shopping and contribute to an unique city every time you play !<br>Furnish and improve your home !<br>Color furniture, clothes and fixtures by adding dyes to create an infinite variety of colors !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/8e6006119376e76766ca013b411ce7b9.webp?t=1713864504\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/e6efa7475e1a63f49649a9aed5ccfec6.poster.avif?t=1713864504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/e6efa7475e1a63f49649a9aed5ccfec6.webm?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/e6efa7475e1a63f49649a9aed5ccfec6.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Increase your friendship with the villagers, or even more. Each villager has its own personality, which can change depending on what you say and your actions !<br>Cook or go to the Gronks restaurant, and get bonuses when you eat a variety of foods !<br>Help the villagers to gain trust and unlock new crafts !<br>Evolve your relationships with the villagers based on your conversations and actions !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/a56f604943feb443d387783900bcad77.webp?t=1713864504\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/f5fa8c398703f118523a0505dedbcc95.poster.avif?t=1713864504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/f5fa8c398703f118523a0505dedbcc95.webm?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/f5fa8c398703f118523a0505dedbcc95.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Searching for your mother will lead you to discover special and unexplored places, solve puzzles!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/477546ca4c94fb6ce138c281bc213ac2.webp?t=1713864504\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/97cfcdac454942fe84a770614f4f07b4.poster.avif?t=1713864504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/97cfcdac454942fe84a770614f4f07b4.webm?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/97cfcdac454942fe84a770614f4f07b4.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Discover new crafts through story, quests and random events!<br>Learn new crafts at the Learning Center!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/0ef972b64b65dba5074bcfde6e698d38.poster.avif?t=1713864504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/0ef972b64b65dba5074bcfde6e698d38.webm?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/0ef972b64b65dba5074bcfde6e698d38.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create electrical circuits with logic gates!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/306b4c4b98c40697486a9917a9247f8e.poster.avif?t=1713864504\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/306b4c4b98c40697486a9917a9247f8e.webm?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397300/extras/306b4c4b98c40697486a9917a9247f8e.mp4?t=1713864504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Program your robot and make your own 3d prints!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current game mechanics :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For each game, an island, a mine and a city all procedurally generated, mixing randomness and player choice !<br></li><li>Random events and quests!<br></li><li>Plenty of room to build as you wish!<br></li><li>Different ressources repartition in each island generated !</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Incoming game mechanices :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More farming mechanics and plants will be added !<br></li><li>Exploration of other islands than the main island, with random biomes and ressources !<br></li><li>Remaining story parts is being added each updates !</li></ul>",
